Description: block-pushing puzzle game with generated levels
 Soak the Bun is a Sokoban-style puzzle game. You are a little water drop
 and must push every hamburger bun into a puddle. Buns can only be pushed,
 never pulled, and only one at a time.
 .
 All 999 levels are generated by the game and are always solvable, and
 they get harder as more buns are added. The game offers unlimited undo
 and hints that show the next push.
 .
 All graphics and sound are generated by the game while it runs.
